      "content": "Even if you have a history of migraines, a sudden, extremely severe pain that isn't responding to your usual medication requires caution. While sleep can sometimes help with migraines, the combination of extreme pain and nausea warrants a check-in with a healthcare professional. Please monitor your symptoms closely and seek medical advice if the headache worsens, changes character, or if you develop any concerning new symptoms.",
