    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like going to the hospital is such an overreaction for a headache. i feel like if i really had something serious like a stroke or whatever, i'd know, right? like it would be more than just nausea and a bad headache. can i just try taking some more ibuprofen and maybe a nap? i really just want to sleep this off and see how i feel in the morning.",
